      "trackName": "Capture Squares: Dot Boxes",
      "description": "Capture Squares — the classic dots-and-boxes strategy game, built for Apple Watch.\n\nTap to draw a line between two dots. Complete the fourth side of a box to claim it — and take another turn. Claim more squares than a smart AI to win. The timeless pencil-and-paper classic, now on your wrist. No phone needed.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n• One-tap play — tap an edge to draw a line\n• Smart AI with real chain/double-cross strategy, scaling in difficulty\n• NEW Daily Challenge — a fresh puzzle every day, difficulty ramps through the week, build a streak\n• Board sizes from 3×3 to 5×5 — quick glanceable rounds\n• Pure strategy, no luck\n• Play fully offline, anytime\n• Progress & stats saved automatically\n• Built native for Apple Watch — no ads, no in-app purchases",
